OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for new #3.5m city centre
OL,4,Alink approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a #3.5m revamp of a part of
OL,7,FLeicester city centre have taken a step
OL,8,Fforward.
OL,10,FLeicester City Council has approved an
OL,11,Fapplication to demolish empty shops it
OL,12,Fowns to create a new link between Green
OL,13,FDragon Square and St Martin's Square.
OL,15,FAccording to planning documents the
OL,16,Fproposed demolition of the existing
OL,17,Fbuildings at 12-20 Market Place would
OL,18,Fcreate a "clear, step-free route and an
OL,19,Fopportunity for people to pause, meet
OL,20,Fand enjoy greenery in the city centre".
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
